     "\r\n  \r\n\r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n    <p>El próximo <b>martes 7 de Noviembre</b> tendremos nuestra\r\n      reunión mensual del <a href=\"https://sevillarusers.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sevillarusers.wordpress.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243243384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0aQ7cf-P_9J8_FvmCsOJ4T\">grupo de usuarios de\r\n        R en Sevilla</a>. El encuentro será en el <b>aula TIC1</b>\r\n      (segunda planta) del edificio <a href=\"https://bib.us.es/ulloa/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bib.us.es/ulloa/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243243384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw25qGvIY-RRrqa1xQ-C0oXd\">CRAI</a>\r\n      del campus de Reina Mercedes (<a href=\"https://www.google.es/maps/place/37%C2%B021%2736.0%22N+5%C2%B059%2712.8%22W/@37.360003,-5.9876184,18z/data=%213m1%214b1%214m2%213m1%211s0x0:0x0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.google.es/maps/place/37%25C2%25B021%252736.0%2522N%2B5%25C2%25B059%252712.8%2522W/@37.360003,-5.9876184,18z/data%3D%25213m1%25214b1%25214m2%25213m1%25211s0x0:0x0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243243384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Q2kPFeerOW-ts_PpDe-15\">mapa</a>),\r\n      a las 19 horas.</p>\r\n    <a href=\"https://www.meetup.com/es-ES/Sevilla-R-users/members/224279902/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.meetup.com/es-ES/Sevilla-R-users/members/224279902/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243243384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1eb1pJcnacYaNNBwDSb_Tv\">Miguel\r\n      Ángel Porras</a> y <a href=\"https://www.meetup.com/es-ES/Sevilla-R-users/members/207678326/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.meetup.com/es-ES/Sevilla-R-users/members/207678326/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243243384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2UaZQ-9TVs5dZRg1EO56yt\">Juan\r\n      Andrés Tejero</a> se han ofrecido amablemente a contarnos su\r\n    trabajo como científicos de datos en <a href=\"https://generagames.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://generagames.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243243384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0O0zN9bEspoja4wyQJtEIT\">Genera Games</a>. Particularmente\r\n    cómo utilizan R y Rmarkdown para analizar los datos de uso de manera\r\n    dinámica.<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    Os esperamos<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    Saludos<br>\r\n    <pre cols=\"72\">-- \r\nDr Francisco Rodriguez-Sanchez\r\nIntegrative Ecology Group\r\nEstacion Biologica de Doñana (CSIC)\r\nAvda. Americo Vespucio 26\r\nE-41092 Sevilla (Spain)\r\n<a href=\"http://bit.ly/frod_san\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bit.ly/frod_san&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243243384000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mOc8BOeFYF58V8NyThDYJ\">http://bit.ly/frod_san</a></pre>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n"
